  "text": "The number of integers between 1 and 500 (both inclusive) that are divisible by 3 or 5 or 7 is ______.",
  "options": [],
  "answer": "271",
  "solution": "|A| = floor(500/3) = 166, |B| = 100, |C| = 71; |A n B| = floor(500/15) = 33, |A n C| = floor(500/21) = 23, |B n C| = floor(500/35) = 14; |A n B n C| = floor(500/105) = 4. So 166+100+71-33-23-14+4 = 271.",
